            <ArticleTitle>Norpethidine toxicity and patient controlled analgesia.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>738-40</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Patient-controlled analgesia (PCA) with i.v. opioids is prescribed increasingly. We report three cases of norpethidine toxicity in patients receiving pethidine by PCA.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
